  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### Recurring invoices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Sat, 4 Oct, 2025 at 12:35 PM\n\nThis is to inform you that the recurring invoices are sent automatically only if the relevant tick box is selected for each customer under the Contact List. Please ensure this option is enabled for all applicable clients to allow automatic sending of recurring invoices (refer to attached) \n\n\t\tAnnotated - ... (112 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Recurring invoices\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Sat, 4 Oct, 2025 at 12:35 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px\">\n<div></div>\n<div></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none\">This is to inform you that the recurring invoices are sent automatically only if the relevant tick box is selected for each customer under the Contact List. Please ensure this option is enabled for all applicable clients to allow automatic sending of recurring invoices (refer to attached)</span>&nbsp;<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t<div class=\"cs-g-c attachments\" id=\"article-90002